<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n13852" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπό-στημα</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ατος</span>,
			τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>distance, interval,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. τοῦ ἡλίου πρὸς τὴν γῆν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Cael.</u>
					294a4
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν σφαιρῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Metaph.</u>
					1073b33
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Sign.</u>
				9
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξ ἀ. θεωρεῖσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Epicur.
					<u>Ep.</u>
					2p.39U.
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅπλα τὰ ἐξ ἀ. λεγόμενα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ascl.
					<u>Tact.</u>
					1.2
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>degree</i> of descent from an ancestor, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῖς ἀ. πρὸς τοὺς γονεῖς παντοδαπῶς
					ἔχειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>EN</u>
					1100a26
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>abscess,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Aph.</u>
				7.36
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				885b31
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>Od.</u>
				59
			</span></i>.</div>
